1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
“Saying you're busy is a sign of low status.”

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,133
It's Tim Denning,

3
00:00:04,153 --> 00:00:07,240
whose bio claims 1B+ views and $6M+ earned.

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,360
Busyness means you can't focus

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,190
and your life is out of control.

6
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:12,162
The fix: delete calendar events as fast as you can,

7
00:00:12,182 --> 00:00:14,120
and make room for living.

8
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,098
Lesson 14: many successful people,

9
00:00:16,118 --> 00:00:18,750
like Keanu Reeves, are bizarrely quiet.

10
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:20,000
Most people talk but never listen;

11
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:23,050
say nothing for a whole conversation and you learn the most.

12
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:25,055
Lesson 19: keeping your dopamine

13
00:00:25,075 --> 00:00:27,240
in check beats any other health hack.

14
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,874
The list: TikTok, Netflix, video games,

15
00:00:29,894 --> 00:00:32,290
anything with an easy payoff.

16
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,846
Lesson 28: games are fine when you're young,

17
00:00:34,866 --> 00:00:37,770
but later they're a time suck.

18
00:00:37,790 --> 00:00:40,540
Lesson 31: flow states matter more than productivity.

19
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,989
To-do lists won't motivate you;

20
00:00:42,009 --> 00:00:44,620
feeling 8 hours pass like 1 hour will.

21
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,781
Lesson 21 says turning off news and politics raises your IQ.

22
00:00:46,801 --> 00:00:49,800
Evidence? The article gives none.

23
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,049
Being busy buys no status.

24
00:00:51,069 --> 00:00:53,180
Free time is what's worth something.
